    "updated_at": "2025-09-23T09:13:11Z",
    "body": "I think re-building the spec with the latest (or the online) version of Bikeshed should be enough to fix the link. I typically get the right link when I run `make` on my end.\n\nBrowser-specs does not have any information about this spec, [Specref does](https://www.specref.org/?q=UTS46) and updated itself appropriately. Bikeshed also picked up that data in [bikeshed-data](https://github.com/speced/bikeshed-data/blob/main/data/biblio/biblio-ut.data#L254) (the read-only copy in the bikeshed repo is mainly used for tests but Bikeshed retrieves the info from bikeshed-data when it refreshes itself).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
